{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03357",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 3.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Right then, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.52,
      "end_seconds": 6.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Hi, um, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.26,
      "end_seconds": 8.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.45,
      "end_seconds": 17.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I've been dealing with headaches most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.88,
      "end_seconds": 23.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.85,
      "end_seconds": 36.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.04,
      "end_seconds": 64.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.87,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 113 over 70, oxygen saturation is 97 percent. And heart rate 73, respiratory rate 18, temperature is 36.5 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.38,
      "end_seconds": 67.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.43,
      "end_seconds": 76.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly. When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.05,
      "end_seconds": 80.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Since last weekend, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.41,
      "end_seconds": 91.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Ah. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.32,
      "end_seconds": 101.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "hmm, it settles a little with painkillers a three out of ten, I suppose"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.98,
      "end_seconds": 105.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.81,
      "end_seconds": 118.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "Taking painkillers every day goes along with it, most of the time. The Taking painkillers every day? That's been for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.33,
      "end_seconds": 121.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.17,
      "end_seconds": 125.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "I'd say a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.58,
      "end_seconds": 130.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Have you noticed visual changes, weakness, stiff neck or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.67,
      "end_seconds": 135.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.38,
      "end_seconds": 139.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.58,
      "end_seconds": 143.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.8,
      "end_seconds": 146.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.84,
      "end_seconds": 149.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.26,
      "end_seconds": 170.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.87,
      "end_seconds": 181.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "I've had migraines for about ten years now. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.14,
      "end_seconds": 185.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.21,
      "end_seconds": 190.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.8,
      "end_seconds": 193.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.93,
      "end_seconds": 199.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.39,
      "end_seconds": 209.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.11,
      "end_seconds": 214.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.23,
      "end_seconds": 219.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.09,
      "end_seconds": 224.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.43,
      "end_seconds": 226.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.54,
      "end_seconds": 231.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.68,
      "end_seconds": 248.05,
      "duration_seconds": 15.37,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: I think we're dealing with medication-overuse headache on a background of migraine at this stage. Tension-type headache is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.09,
      "end_seconds": 273.25,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "I think a headache diary makes sense here, for daily headache. I'd like you to take amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. That's for headache prevention."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.63,
      "end_seconds": 277.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "How soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.4,
      "end_seconds": 290.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "stop the daily painkillers gradually, the headaches may worsen for a couple of weeks first a short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.2,
      "end_seconds": 305.4,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. I'll want another look in six weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.97,
      "end_seconds": 310.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Actually, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.94,
      "end_seconds": 314.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
}